.turbo/

# Gitleaks report
gitleaks-report.json

# IaC variable files may carry operator CIDRs / identity; never commit real ones
infra/**/*.tfvars
!infra/**/*.example.tfvars

# IaC reproducibility harness runtime artifacts (never commit state/plans/ledgers)
infra/**/*.tfstate
infra/**/*.tfstate.*
infra/**/*.tfplan
infra/**/.terraform/
# Lockfile policy (Phase 1B-COST-SAFETY, resolved intentionally): the lab
# root's dependency lockfile IS committed (reproducibility: it pins the
# exact provider builds the two-cycle proof runs against), so only provider
# module dirs keep theirs ignored. The committed lockfile must contain only
# the expected providers (cloudflare + hashicorp/aws); the escape suite and
# review enforce that.
infra/providers/**/.terraform.lock.hcl
*.opnory-iac-evidence.json
*.mutations.jsonl
opnory-iac-mutations.jsonl
opnory-iac-evidence.json

# Live governance TypeScript config (generated)
scripts/live-governance/tsconfig.json